  "canon:pmid": "28203080",
  "canon:title": "A fully integrated new paradigm for lithium's mode of action - lithium utilizes latent cellular fail-safe mechanisms.",
  "canon:abstract": "It is proposed that lithium's therapeutic effects occur indirectly by augmenting a cascade of protective \"fail-safe\" pathways pre-configured to activate in response to a dangerous low cell [Mg++] situation, eg, posttraumatic brain injury, alongside relative cell adenosine triphosphate depletion. Lithium activates cell protection, as it neatly mimics a lowered intracellular [Mg++] level.",
  "canon:text": "A fully integrated new paradigm for lithium's mode of action - lithium utilizes latent cellular fail-safe mechanisms. It is proposed that lithium's therapeutic effects occur indirectly by augmenting a cascade of protective \"fail-safe\" pathways pre-configured to activate in response to a dangerous low cell [Mg++] situation, eg, posttraumatic brain injury, alongside relative cell adenosine triphosphate depletion. Lithium activates cell protection, as it neatly mimics a lowered intracellular [Mg++] level.",
